<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>

<body class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-900">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-6 bg-white shadow-lg rounded-lg my-10">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy for <%= appName %>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Effective Date: <%= effectiveDate %>
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6">Introduction</h2>
        <p>Welcome to <%= appName %>. We value your privacy and are dedicated to safeguarding your personal
                information...</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By using our app, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy...</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6">Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
            <li><strong>Personal Information</strong>: Name, Email, Mobile Number, etc.</li>
            <li><strong>Device Information</strong>: Device type, OS version, and unique identifiers.</li>
            <li><strong>Crash Data</strong>: Collected via Crashlytics for app stability.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>The information collected is used for service delivery, communication, and user experience improvement...</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6">Data Security</h2>
        <p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal data...</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6">Your Rights</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Manage permissions through device settings.</li>
            <li>Opt out of notifications anytime.</li>
            <li>Request access to your personal data.</li>
            <li>Delete your account by contacting us. <a class="text-blue-600 underline" href=<%= delete_acc_link %> >Delete Account</a> </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6">Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions, please contact us at:</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong>
            <%= contactEmail %>
        </p>
        <p><strong>Phone:</strong>
            <%= contactPhone %>
        </p>
    </div>
</body>

</html>